# code-is-decision — slice 4c PARTIAL-split FHIR golden fixture.
library "Code Is Decision".

// A decision-bearing library (which disqualifies the FULL layered auto-split)
// that ALSO carries concept-level `code is` codes. The CQL lane partial-splits
// it into `Code Is Decision Concepts` (the lowered local codes) + `Code Is
// Decision` (the Root, which keeps the source name so the Decision/Activity
// `library[]` refs resolve). The FHIR lane (slice 4c / E) therefore emits TWO
// Libraries: the Root depends-on the Concepts Library; the Concepts Library
// depends-on the local CodeSystem.

concept "Adult Patient":
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `adult-18-or-older`.

concept "Active Crohns Disease":
- type is Condition.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `active-crohns-disease`.

activity "Refer to GI":
- request CPGServiceRequest.

decision "Triage Crohns":
- when "Active Crohns Disease" then recommend activity "Refer to GI".
